    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_title">bikule bot a, amin bot a</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_lifetime_body">bikule bot a mbe kuε manda, kɔtɔ bo: embi ye a tamɛ etala ne, na bikule ye bot a eve ye ndung zeliβo a kelo.</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_title">efan na minkolo</string>
    <string name="welcome_point_detailed_body">tiyo ye a vul me mbege ateng efan na minkolo eme tim. android atɔmba mɔnɔ ye efan menguma kumene a ndung ya mam, menguma zε a vul zε ti ndung bɔtɔ eve. bluetooth ateng a keme mɔli mɔ zə zɔ mɔ.</string>
